        "en": "It is the only kind of bear that lives wild in Taiwan.",
        "zh": "牠是臺灣唯一野生的熊。"
      },
      {
        "en": "It is a good climber and makes \"nests\" of branches up in trees.",
        "zh": "牠很會爬樹，還會在樹上用樹枝做「熊窩」。"
      }
    ],
    "habitat": {
      "en": "Mountain forests, mostly between 1,000 and 3,500 metres up.",
      "zh": "山區森林，大多在海拔1,000到3,500公尺之間。"
